# Wetlands - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans and manuals whose SOURCE is physically in
# the Wetlands, verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever
# item vendor and drop tables). Twelve recipes are vendor-sold by in-zone
# Alliance vendors (Jennabink Powerseam, Stuart Fleming, Wenna Silkbeard,
# Fradd Swiftgear - no Horde-only vendor stock exists here); four more drop
# each from named in-zone mobs, three of them honestly noted as also
# dropping in one neighboring zone each. Everything else Wetlands-dropping
# is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest records carry no reward
# data, so neither ships (see docs/wetlands-companions-inventory.md and
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Blacksmithing, First Aid
# and Fishing have no Wetlands source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/wetlands-recipes
title Wetlands - Recipes & Patterns
levels 20-30
zone Wetlands
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords wetlands, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Menethil Harbor vendors - Jennabink's stock (Tailoring)

  zone map 1437

  when skill Tailoring 1

  tip Jennabink Powerseam (8.12, 55.84) sells patterns in Menethil Harbor.
  buy 5772 "Pattern: Red Woolen Bag"
  buy 6275 "Pattern: Greater Adept's Robe"
  buy 253665 "Pattern: Linen Reagent Bag"
  buy 253668 "Pattern: Woolen Reagent Bag"

step Menethil Harbor vendors - Stuart's stock (Cooking)

  zone map 1437

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Stuart Fleming (8.02, 58.35) sells recipes in Menethil Harbor.
  buy 6368 "Recipe: Rainbow Fin Albacore"
  buy 6369 "Recipe: Rockscale Cod"
  buy 17062 "Recipe: Mithril Head Trout"

step Dun Modr vendors - Wenna's stock (Tailoring, Leatherworking)

  zone map 1437

  when skill Tailoring 1

  tip Wenna Silkbeard (25.61, 25.80) sells patterns at Dun Modr.
  buy 7114 "Pattern: Azure Silk Gloves"

step Dun Modr vendors - Wenna's leather stock (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1437

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  tip Wenna Silkbeard (25.61, 25.80) sells patterns at Dun Modr.
  buy 7290 "Pattern: Red Whelp Gloves"
  buy 7613 "Pattern: Green Leather Armor"

step Dun Modr vendors - Fradd's stock (Engineering)

  zone map 1437

  when skill Engineering 1

  tip Fradd Swiftgear (26.40, 25.76) sells schematics at Dun Modr.
  buy 13309 "Schematic: Lovingly Crafted Boomstick"
  buy 14639 "Schematic: Minor Recombobulator"

step North-west - murloc armor (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1437

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  goto 15.45,23.61
  kill 1160 optional
  collect 5788 "Pattern: Thick Murloc Armor" optional
  note Captain Halyndor (level 30) in the north-west is the named in-zone dropper; the same pattern also drops in Stranglethorn, so this is a genuine Wetlands source, not the only one. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Dun Modr - mining enchant (Enchanting)

  zone map 1437

  when skill Enchanting 1

  loop
  goto 47.19,15.69
  goto 47.59,16.97
  goto 48.01,16.61
  goto 46.44,16.18
  goto 46.74,17.21
  goto 46.81,16.44
  goto 45.65,16.85
  goto 45.68,16.19
  goto 45.95,16.85
  goto 46.50,18.74
  goto 47.39,14.99
  goto 47.57,14.73
  kill 1051 optional
  kill 1052 optional
  kill 1053 optional
  kill 1054 optional
  collect 11150 "Formula: Enchant Gloves - Mining" optional
  note The Dark Iron clan at Dun Modr (levels 27-30) are the named in-zone droppers; the same formula also drops in Arathi, so this is a genuine Wetlands source, not the only one - and the above-band Balgaras the Foul is not routed. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step South-center - raptor bites (Cooking)

  zone map 1437

  when skill Cooking 1

  loop
  goto 19.77,52.47
  goto 20.72,48.80
  goto 21.37,51.91
  kill 1020 optional
  collect 250187 "Recipe: Tasty Raptor Bites" optional
  note The Mottled Raptor (level 22) in the south-center is the named in-zone dropper; the same recipe also drops in Durotar, so this is a genuine Wetlands source, not the only one. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Dun Modr - jumbo dynamite (Engineering)

  zone map 1437

  when skill Engineering 1

  loop
  goto 46.50,18.74
  goto 47.39,14.99
  goto 47.57,14.73
  kill 1054 optional
  collect 264208 "Schematic: SAF-T Jumbo Dynamite" optional
  note The Dark Iron Demolitionist (level 30) at Dun Modr is the sole placed dropper in the data - the other listed dropper has no spawn points anywhere, so it is not routed. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step No Wetlands source — other professions

  zone map 1437

  note Blacksmithing, First Aid and Fishing have no recipe source physically in the Wetlands in the data — no vendor sells them here and no in-zone mob drops them — so this guide carries nothing for them. Polestar's own profession guides cover trainer-taught staples.
